# Unreal binary assets. Marked binary so Git never attempts line-ending
# conversion or textual diffs on them.
#
# NOTE: Git LFS is deliberately NOT used. The committed assets are small
# (largest file ~36 MB, repository ~225 MB), and avoiding LFS keeps the
# repository clonable by anyone without consuming LFS bandwidth quota --
# which matters for a long-lived archival research artifact.
*.uasset binary
*.umap   binary
*.png    binary
*.fbx    binary
*.wav    binary

# Normalise line endings for text we author.
*.cpp text eol=lf
*.h   text eol=lf
*.cs  text eol=lf
*.md  text eol=lf
*.ini text eol=crlf
*.uproject text eol=lf
